        {
            "id": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/get-out-and-about/",
            "url": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/get-out-and-about/",
            "title": "Get out and about",
            "summary": "As part of our local impact mappers badges we go out and about in Frome. This is designed to highlight&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>As part of our local impact mappers badges we go out and about in Frome. This is designed to highlight where local services are design to help people that may need it. Be that some space to just sit and think or something practicle like the communit fridge. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/PXL_20260423_180343855.jpg\" data-size=\"3072x4080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/PXL_20260423_180343855-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1020\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_PXL_20260423_180009077.jpg\" data-size=\"4080x3072\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_PXL_20260423_180009077-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"578\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.45.jpeg\" data-size=\"1536x2048\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.45-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.46.jpeg\" data-size=\"1536x2048\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.46-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/PXL_20260423_175117137.MP.jpg\" data-size=\"3072x4080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/PXL_20260423_175117137.MP-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1020\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>We first vitisited <a href=\"https://thegoodheart.uk/\">The Good Heart |</a> </p>\n<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Encouraging health and happiness and alleviating loneliness and isolation in Frome by:</span></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ul class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\">Offering free hot drinks and affordable meals in our pay-it-forward cafe​</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Hosting a range of ‘wellbeing spaces’, events, and like-minded groups</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Coordinating the annual Frome Kindness Festival</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>And the Frome food bank <a href=\"https://fairfrome.org/food-bank/\">Food Bank - Fair Frome</a></p>",
            "author": {
                "name": "GSL"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Cubs"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-05-07T12:10:46+01:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-07T12:10:46+01:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/thank-you/",
            "url": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/thank-you/",
            "title": "Thank you !",
            "summary": "The fact of the matter is, running anything in the volunteering world takes a lot of time and usually very&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>The fact of the matter is, running anything in the volunteering world takes a lot of time and usually very little thanks. But that’s not why we do it. We do it because we want to give something back. Most of us came through youth clubs, Scouts, football teams — whatever it was — and we look back at the leaders who shaped us. They probably never realised the impact they had, but we did, and now we’re just trying to give even half of that back to the next lot coming through.</p>\n<p>Today was one of those days that hits you a bit. Watching our Cubs move up is always emotional. You hope they’ve enjoyed their time with you, that they felt safe, included, and had a bit of fun along the way. We’ve seen them come in tiny, shy, sometimes terrified… and then slowly grow into more confident, capable, rounded young people.<br>And the funny thing is, while we’re busy trying to help them grow, they end up shaping us too.</p>\n<p>Every camp, every badge, every meltdown, every proud moment — it all sticks with you. We give our time freely, but what we get back in those little moments are worth more, but getting this as a thank you just makes it feel even more special </p>\n<figure class=\"post__image align-center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"987\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px\" srcset=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/responsive/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/responsive/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/responsive/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/responsive/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/responsive/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/responsive/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-2xl.jpg 1600w\"></figure>",
            "image": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/28/PXL_20251219_110137526.MP~2-2.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "GSL"
            },
