            "title": "Remembrance Sunday 2025",
            "summary": "Once again we had the privalage of attending the 2025 Frome Remembrance Sunday parade.",
            "content_html": "<p>Once again we had the privalage of attending the 2025 Frome Remembrance Sunday parade. </p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_103958631.MP.jpg\" data-size=\"3648x2736\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_103958631.MP-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_104127023.MP.jpg\" data-size=\"3648x2736\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_104127023.MP-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_104134239.MP.jpg\" data-size=\"3648x2736\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_104134239.MP-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_110616800.MP.jpg\" data-size=\"3072x4080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_110616800.MP-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1020\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_111351155.MP.jpg\" data-size=\"3072x4080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/27/gallery/PXL_20251109_111351155.MP-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1020\">