        {
            "id": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/1st-and-7th-new-chair/",
            "url": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/1st-and-7th-new-chair/",
            "title": "1st and 7th New Chair",
            "summary": "Hi , I’m Paul and I am the new Chair person for 1st and 7th Frome ‘Jubilee’ Scout group. Firstly&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div dir=\"auto\">Hi , I’m Paul and I am the new Chair person for 1st and 7th Frome ‘Jubilee’ Scout group.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\" dir=\"auto\"><figure class=\"align-center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://scontent-lhr8-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/598249591_1270130988491428_2374644156965818049_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=106&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=cBBP4RwQugcQ7kNvwEGWRIN&amp;_nc_oc=AdnXe6qwFZHfaz3N8G9ro5hgnlPeOSXiwaipmczCH-bgyyncbA91dYrwzO_8BiVwJT4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.xx&amp;_nc_gid=be4bMJ2E3VDjGOx-pOBaJg&amp;oh=00_AfnsLNHOxLMD3yAjbojt4zrQkmT0mN6r17M4ETeW3HFxIA&amp;oe=694472D5\" alt=\"May be an image of one or more people, beard and glasses\" width=\"365\" height=\"487\" data-is-external-image=\"true\"></figure></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Firstly I have to say a huge thank you to Emma who has been facilitating this <a class=\"html-a xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>role and done some outstanding work behind the scenes to support the group.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">A little about me, I have some experience of working with a Scout Group previously having moved to Frome from Bristol. In my earlier days I have been a Cub Scout, Scout, Venture Scout and an Assistant Leader and this was such an important part of my life.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">I have taken on this role in Frome to help support the amazing work that the leaders and Exec team are already doing to help develop the members in this incredible activity.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">I will be posting quite a bit on behalf of the group and I would love to hear from anyone that would like to get involved to help see these youngsters develop.</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"> </div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">It’s such a rewarding activity.</div>",
            "image": "https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/26/598249591_1270130988491428_2374644156965818049_n.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "GSL"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Group"
            ],
            "date_published": "2025-12-14T10:28:45+00:00",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-14T11:47:43+00:00"
        },
        {
