            "title": "New Scouts investing",
            "summary": "What a great night for the Scouts last night. Investing a total of 8 new Scouts into the group. 3&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<figure class=\"post__image align-center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1440\" height=\"986\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px\" srcset=\"https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//responsive/463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//responsive/463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//responsive/463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//responsive/463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//responsive/463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/16//responsive/463231234_938810521623478_3504976376925796108_n-2xl.jpg 1600w\"></figure>\n<p>What a great night for the Scouts last night. Investing a total of 8 new Scouts into the group. 3 of these have moved up from Cubs and the remaining are new intakes. Its great to see the group and Scouts thriving.</p>",
